@itemize
@item
@code{timeout}
<@uref{https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#Number_type,number}>
Maximum navigation time in milliseconds, defaults to 30 seconds, pass
@code{0} to disable timeout. The default value can be changed by using
the
@ref{#pagesetdefaultnavigationtimeouttimeout,page.setDefaultNavigationTimeout(timeout)}
or @ref{#pagesetdefaulttimeouttimeout,page.setDefaultTimeout(timeout)}
