@code{keypress}/@code{input}, and @code{keyup} event for each character
in the text.

To press a special key, like @code{Control} or @code{ArrowDown}, use
@ref{#elementhandlepresskey-options,@code{elementHandle.press}}.

@verbatim
elementHandle.type('Hello'); // Types instantly
elementHandle.type('World', {delay: 100}); // Types slower, like a user
@end verbatim

An example of typing into a text field and then submitting the form:

@verbatim
const elementHandle = await page.$('input');
await elementHandle.type('some text');
await elementHandle.press('Enter');
@end verbatim

